Exclude web_sys ExternalImage APIs on wasm32-linux.

wgpu-types gates browser copy-external-image types on target_arch=wasm32,
but wasm32-unknown-linux-musl is not a browser target and web-sys types
are unavailable. Narrow the cfg to non-linux wasm32.

